  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Raat das baje, college ke baad tum girlfriend ke saath OYO pahunche, reception pe Chachu khade the.",
      "start": 0.18,
      "end": 5.355,
      "startFrame": 5,
      "endFrame": 161
    },
    {
      "text": "Ghar mein sab sochte hain Chachu office mein manager hain, par unki naukri, teen mahine pehle chali gayi.",
      "start": 5.58,
      "end": 10.275,
      "startFrame": 167,
      "endFrame": 308
    },
    {
      "text": "Nazrein mili, Chachu ne dheere se kaha, tu kuch mat bolna, main bhi kuch nahi bolunga.",
      "start": 10.44,
      "end": 14.175,
      "startFrame": 313,
      "endFrame": 425
    },
    {
      "text": "Agle din dinner pe, Dadi boli, mera beta manager hai, aur pota college topper.",
      "start": 14.46,
      "end": 19.065,
      "startFrame": 434,
      "endFrame": 572
    },
    {
      "text": "Tabhi Papa ne poocha, kal raat kahan the?",
      "start": 19.14,
      "end": 21.245,
      "startFrame": 574,
      "endFrame": 637
    },
    {
      "text": "A, sirf apna sach bolo.",
      "start": 21.382,
      "end": 22.935,
      "startFrame": 641,
      "endFrame": 688
    },
    {
      "text": "B, dono ka sach bol do.",
      "start": 23.19,
      "end": 24.705,
      "startFrame": 696,
      "endFrame": 741
    },
    {
      "text": "C, chup raho, dono raaz rakho.",
      "start": 24.99,
      "end": 26.985,
      "startFrame": 750,
      "endFrame": 810
    },
    {
      "text": "D, Chachu ka raaz bolo, apna chhupao.",
      "start": 27.21,
      "end": 29.475,
      "startFrame": 816,
      "endFrame": 884
    },
    {
      "text": "Tum kya karoge? Comment karo, answer in the next reel, follow karo @rehanfact!",
      "start": 29.58,
      "end": 34.125,
      "startFrame": 887,
      "endFrame": 1024
    }
  ],
